 "description": "bigville R20 (268000): the NOTICEBOARD -- the council's OFFICIAL written record. cm_clerk_writes has ONE council member (the clerk) write the minutes as a RENDERING: recorded = held_decision + clerk_bias (a biased clerk DISTORTS the record -- institutional 234). cm_post_notice posts it on the town-hall board and marks it officially_known REGARDLESS of who reads. cm_resident_reads: a resident LEARNS the law iff at_hall (R1 access) AND (literate (R18) OR the literacy gate is ablated); an illiterate/distant resident never fires -> officially_known=1 but knows_law_flag=0 (unequal ignorance-of-the-law -- the poor/unschooled less able to know the rules that bind them). Composes existing Terms (And/Or/Eq/Plus/Attr/Var/Lit) -- zero new Rust. self_load_only.",
 "nodes": [],
 "edges": [],
 "productions": [],
 "concepts": [],
